id: supporter-mark
name: Minion Supporter
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Minion Supporter (2)'s - its 1(T), the Master's Tier, as stacks, till the start of the Master's next turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Minion Supporter: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, till the start of your Master's next turn.
text: >
  Minion Supporter (2): That Minion has its Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
